      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="1332c854-cf4f-4947-a292-6389d1cc7505">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 12</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>Note: A gesture to open this dialog can be assigned from NVDA menu, Preferences submenu, Input gestures dialog, Configuration category.</source>
        <target>注意：可以在 NVDA 菜单、选项子菜单、按键与手势对话框的配置类别下分配一个打开此设置的快捷键。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
