    <unit id="6b27af96-60cc-4cb4-9776-0464ac26e9ee">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 16</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>From NVDA's menu, Preferences submenu, Input gestures dialog, reportSymbols category, you can assing a gesture to exclude (or include again) symbols to be reported when typing.</source>
        <target>可以在 NVDA 菜单、选项子菜单、按键与手势对话框的读出符号类别下分配一个快捷键以排除（或再次包含）键入时要读出的符号。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
